- *+--------------------+---------------+--------------------+------------------+
- *| FOCUSED_LOCKED     | AF_TRIGGER    | ACTIVE_SCAN        | Start new sweep  |
- *|                    |               |                    | Lens now moving  |
- *+--------------------+---------------+--------------------+------------------+
- *| NOT_FOCUSED_LOCKED | AF_CANCEL     | INACTIVE           | Cancel/reset AF  |
- *+--------------------+---------------+--------------------+------------------+
